{"id":"prepositions-0126","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 126","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Can I borrow a pen ___ you?","hint":"borrow ___ / lend ___","explanation":"borrow FROM (take), lend TO (give)."},{"answer":"about","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The press joked ___ the politician\u0027s hat.","hint":"joke ___ sth","explanation":"joke ABOUT something."},{"answer":"at","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"We arrived ___ the airport two hours early.","hint":"arrive ___ (place), ___ (city)","explanation":"arrive AT a point (airport, hotel), IN a city/country."},{"answer":"between","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"What\u0027s the difference ___ these two phones?","hint":"difference ___ two things","explanation":"difference BETWEEN two things (difference IN price/size for the respect in which)."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Who is responsible ___ locking up?","hint":"responsible ___ sth","explanation":"responsible FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"about","accept":["about"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m a bit anxious ___ the results.","hint":"anxious ___ sth (worried)","explanation":"anxious ABOUT something = worried about it."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s keen ___ joining the photography club.","hint":"keen ___ sth/doing","explanation":"keen ON something/doing something."},{"answer":"into","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The lorry crashed ___ the back of the bus.","hint":"crash ___ sth","explanation":"crash INTO something solid (hit it)."}]}